<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span id="docs-internal-guid-e4d15dda-7fff-0d3b-fa30-6216bb3b41e3"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Verdana; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Hello,</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Verdana; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">You are receiving this email today as our last email regarding it has bounced back as undeliverable. Due to the importance of this update to our calls product we’re reaching out again today to notify you of the changes.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Verdana; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Beginning </span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Verdana; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">March 1, 2022</span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Verdana; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> we increased our </span><a href="https://f.hubspotusercontent20.net/hubfs/2287971/New%20Call%20Pricing.pdf" style="text-decoration-line: none;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Verdana; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; text-decoration-line: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">warm transfer call pricing</span></a><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Verdana; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> to help address agent pain points around lack of call inventory and predictability.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Verdana; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">In fact, with these changes </span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Verdana; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">we anticipate auto call volume to increase by 60% (on average)</span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Verdana; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> in the near term with a vision to double volume in the next 12 months!</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Verdana; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">EverQuote</span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Verdana; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> calls convert at nearly 8X the rate of data leads across all agent affiliations</span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Verdana; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">. Implementing these changes will allow us to generate more calls, increase call delivery rates and help improve business outcomes for our agents.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">&nbsp;</p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Verdana; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">If you have any questions or concerns, or if you would like to learn about the range of available EverQuote products that can help fuel your agency growth, please contact your EverQuote Customer Success Representative directly or our Support team at (844) 707-8800.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Verdana; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;text-align: center;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Verdana; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:409px;height:287px;"><img src="https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/XxesRKrSGOtj9wEuGET0mNly4jCzJTGp3B3Nt_0cQrkqLyH_e0ohWNyNG0sqZNPyw7D6WZgpzFTa3f0BvYV-ACtA6BTSl7vENaFqBRiT0izAX7SCtnvLNYEcoga7T5viRQ0-3u5r" width="409" height="287" style="margin-left:0px;margin-top:0px;"></span></span></p><div><br></div><div>Best Regards,</div><div><br></div><div>Nick</div><div><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Verdana; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:409px;height:287px;"><br></span></span></div></span>]]></td>
